@;@ RHP_name: The Scary Bats
@;@ For: The L.O.R.D. Cavern v1.5b+
@;@ Written_by: Donald Tidmore
@;@ Purpose:  Testing different RHP Codes
@;@  Fidonet Email:  1:/123/450
@;@  Email: donald.tidmore@fidotel.com, donald.tidmore@usa.net
@;@  URL: http://www.fidotel.com/public/camelot/camelot5.htm
@;@@PROGRAM@ LORDCAVE
@;@@VERSION@ 1.5b
@;@@NAME@ The Scary Bats
@;@PERCENT@ 80
@;@@SCRIPTVERSION@ 1.07

  `#You are walking in the `$Underground Cavern `#when you see several
  `#scary-looking `9Bats `#hanging from the `%roof `#not far ahead.

  `!  Should you try to run past them?, `$`n `l
@YESNO@
@##N

  `#You decide to take another route.
  `!  Your `%Wisdom `!is rewarded.

@EXPERIENCE@ +300*LEVEL

  `%  You discover a small pile of `$Gold Coins!
  `#And you quickly add them to your pouch.
@GOLD@ +500*LEVEL

  `%You happen across a small pile of `@Emeralds!
@GEMS@ +5
@MORE@

  `%Quickly you snatch them up, and ...
  `$  The gems magically enhance your `@Defense power.
@DEFENSE@ +8

  `!You feel the protective power of your `#`a `$increase.

@GOTO@ @#ENDING

@##Y

`#T`%he bats never see you! You quickly pass under them safely.

  `#  However, some of the bats start flying around you.
  `#Scared that you'll get bitten, you wet yourself.

  `%  Very un-charming behavior.  Looks like you lose some `#Charm.
@CHARM@ %-5

  `%You manage to snag your `2Gems pouch `%on a rock, and
  `%some `#Gems `%fell out of it.
@GEMS@ -3*LEVEL

  `%You trip over another rock, and lose some `2Gold.
@GOLD@ -600*LEVEL

@#ENDING
@END@

@;@ 06/14/03: Minor editing, indentation of some lines.
@;@ 06/14: Display player's name in yellow, in opening line.
@;@ 06/14: Display line with player's Armour Name.
@;@ 06/15: Gems loss.  Changed to 3 Gems * Level.
@;@ 06/15: Small Gold loss added.  600 coins * level.
@;@ 06/17: Changed title of script to "The Scary Bats".

@;@ 06/20 Note: In order for RHPTest to process GEMS code properly
@;@  in script, it is necessary to use 1.5a for VERSION code.
@;@  Otherwise, Rhptest reports Gems going into negative value range.

@;@ 07/01: Added code to give player 5 Gems. v1.06
@;@        Changed defense reward to 8 points, from 5 points.
@;@        Increased experience reward to 300 * level.
@;@ 11/05/03: Removed version number from RHP_Name line.
